# The Proving Grounds hub: the witch spawns at the tool rack, looks around,
# walks to the powder yard, throws a blast charge at the dunes, then walks
# back to the village and fires a bolt at the first hut.
scene proving_grounds
spawn 700 398
ticks 700
zoom 2
at 30 shot hub
at 40 hold left
at 160 release left
at 170 tool 2
at 175 aimrel -120 -20
at 180 tap primary
at 290 shot blast_dunes
at 300 hold right
at 520 release right
at 530 tool 1
at 535 aimrel 140 -30
at 540 tap primary
at 545 tap primary
at 660 shot village_fire
